From 796047ab2aeab1d2178d2eb90bec5aabbcd60dfa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 07:23:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Move dashboard AI assistant to a small trigger chip under Log
 out

Replaces the large inline "Ask AI about your dealers" card on the sales
dashboard with a compact "Ask AI" pill button below the Log out button.
Tapping it opens the same assistant in a dismissible bottom-sheet modal,
which now has its own close (x) button.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GxWPdEf21EL6SvRpGBbX8q
